<h2 style="color: #333;">Welcome to Faultline!</h2>
<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>
<p>Please click the link below to verify your email address:</p>

<p style="margin: 20px 0;">
  <a href="<%= @verification_url %>" style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; padding: 12px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block;">
    Verify Email Address
  </a>
</p>

<p>If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="word-break: break-all; color: #666;"><%= @verification_url %></p>

<p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">This link will expire in 24 hours.</p>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;">
<p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px;">If you didn't create this account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>